  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Master&apos;s Degree Program in Gender Equality(2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operate an integrated program consisting of five modules designed to enhance theoretical knowledge and practical application in various fields. This program aims to empower participants to contribute to gender equality and sustainable development goals in their home countries upon their return.The curriculum integrates gender-focused subjects and interdisciplinary international studies on gender as a cross-cutting issue. It includes both curricular and extra-curricular components to constitute a comprehensive training program. Particularly emphasizing the linkage between theory and practice through education, the training program enhances participants&apos; knowledge, research capabilities, and practical skills.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through a specialized initiative aimed at fostering essential female leaders with expertise in promoting gender equality, policy formulation, and academic and talent development, we contribute to spreading gender equality in developing countries and advancing sustainable development goals.&#xAE00;&#xB85C;&#xBC8C; &#xC5EC;&#xC131;&#xC9C0;&#xB3C4;&#xC790;&#xAC00; &#xAC16;&#xCDB0;&#xC57C;&#xD560; &#xBE44;&#xC804;, &#xC5C5;&#xBB34;&#xB2A5;&#xB825;, &#xC0AC;&#xD68C;&#xC801; &#xAD00;&#xACC4;&#xB2A5;&#xB825;, &#xBB38;&#xD654;&#xC801; &#xC774;&#xD574;&#xB2A5;&#xB825; &#xBC0F; &#xAC1C;&#xC778;&#xC801; &#xC131;&#xCC30;&#xC11C; &#xB4F1;&#xC744; &#xBAA8;&#xB450; &#xAC16;&#xCD98; &#xB2A5;&#xB3C5;&#xC801;&#xC774;&#xACE0; &#xC801;&#xADF9;&#xC801;&#xC778; &#xC5EC;&#xC131;&#xB9AC;&#xB354;&#xB97C; &#xBC30;&#xCD9C;</narrative>
  </description>
